id: SAFE35-1
package: fandhe-workshop-core
test: transition_limit
target: crates/core/src/session.rs
find:         crate::transit::return_after_limit(&mut state, &run_before, &entry_before);
replace:         let _ = (&run_before, &entry_before);
expect-fail: cycle_enter_self_stops_at_limit
expect-fail: cycle_exit_2_stops_at_limit
expect-fail: exit_chain_boundary
note: 上限で止めた後に操作の前の状態へ戻さない（現在の Step が空のまま、以降の入力が無視される）
